Changelog: 07-11-2026 20:23:23

Added. The RPCS3 line under the pills says only the state, in the words every manager uses (owner, 07-11-2026): "Not
installed." with "Install it with the Install button." under it, or "Installed." with "Uninstall with the Uninstall
button." under it. The version installed, what Install takes, another version than the app brings, RPCS3 updated itself,
and a newer RPCS3 are in the line's tooltip; another version and a newer RPCS3 also go to the log, once.

